* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Member    RLISPR
* Version   1.3
* Function  List logical printers
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
*              F(191)    no 'ending at' we read always until end of data
*              F(015)    refresh list after renaming entity
